internal/nex-protocols-common-go-patch/ is a vendored fork of
nex-protocols-common-go with local DataStore changes (an S3 presigner and
adjusted DataStore method behaviour) that Mario & Sonic Rio 2016's
score-attachment flow needs. It keeps its own upstream AGPL-3.0 LICENSE.

The Rio 2016 NEX configuration (game server ID 10190300, access key
63fecb0f, NEX 3.4.7 with the Ranking library bumped to 3.6.0, and the
Structure-header byte layout) was recovered from the retail EUR title and
confirmed against real console captures. No proprietary Nintendo or SEGA
code or assets are included.
